#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:60
#: 0645267b315f452b82ef0232522a6468 08381eb729a246c69bd43f8a8eaaa556
#: 18295aa001a44307a1a3ec2d66fd0fbb 19ba940440cc44ceba332e954c47af03
#: 607fda4740994188bd6f6eb55a326e8b a3d078ff4cdd44f8a3c39a8e6cc2ffb8
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART5 and supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. The SBUS pin is inverted and connected to RX5. When "
"using RX5 or SBUS, the other input should be unconnected. RC can be attached"
" to any UART port as long as the serial port protocol is set to "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and SERIAL7_Protocol  is changed to something other "
"than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART5 上，支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。SBUS 引脚已反相并连接至 RX5。使用 RX5 或 SBUS "
"时，另一个输入应保持未连接状态。RC 也可连接至任意 UART 端口，只需将串口协议设为 ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` 并将 "
"SERIAL7_Protocol 改为 「23」 以外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:63
#: 3b1bb3e15649465194e7a8caf1d98d0e 447b413daf98434181dfcddfde36c379
