msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to "
"connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 接头支持 DJI Air Unit/高清图传连接。协议默认为 DisplayPort。接头的第 1 针为 9V，请勿将其连接到需要 "
"5V 的外设。"

